  "body": "the problem is reproducible with following steps:\r\n1. navigable is [navigated](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsing-the-web.html#navigate) to a page\r\n2. a script running on the page [adds new session history entry by `history.pushState()`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/nav-history-apis.html#shared-history-push%2Freplace-state-steps)\r\n3. [traverse the history by a delta](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsing-the-web.html#traverse-the-history-by-a-delta) is called with delta = -1\r\n4. [apply the history step](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/nav-history-apis.html#shared-history-push%2Freplace-state-steps) unloads a displayed document on step 14.11.1.1\r\n5. [activate history entry](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsing-the-web.html#activate-history-entry) (step 14.11.1.3) fails because document in session history entry that should become active is unloaded although it is same-document navigation backwards.\r\n\r\nit appears to be a bug that 14.11.1.1 step in [apply the history step](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/nav-history-apis.html#shared-history-push%2Freplace-state-steps) unloads document during same-document navigation.\r\n\r\n  ",
